<p>Kar gaye sajjad qaza haaye haaye<br />
Zehr sitamgar ne diya haaye haaye</p>

<p>Zulm se li jaan sitamgaaro'n ne<br />
charqe kohan phat na pada haaye haaye</p>

<p>Ho gaye be waarise sab ahlebait<br />
kar gaya sardaar qaza haaye haaye</p>

<p>chain na paaya kabhi baade hussain<br />
sehte rahe zulmo jafa haaye haaye</p>

<p>Aati hai har ek makaa'n se sada<br />
Haaye ghareebul ghoraba haaye haaye</p>

<p>Mehdi hua mehshar taaza bapa<br />
ro rahe hai aale abaa haaye haaye<br />
</p>